Summary
We are looking for a highly experienced AI Automation Engineer to design and build a sophisticated AI Agent ecosystem that automates the day-to-day operations of our engineering consulting and special inspections company.

This is not a simple chatbot project.

We are looking for someone who understands modern AI agent frameworks (OpenAI, LangGraph, CrewAI, AutoGen, MCP, etc.) and can build a secure business workflow automation platform that performs real work across multiple software systems.

